ompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7492e87e70daff6a317f1fa85f7a67de 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c07b989/uploads/origins/dfc72022-1ca1-4389-846f-cec8fdbbda76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78bbfdaffb82e3be762b875b70304c00 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nI really like your art style and illustrations and I was hoping to commission you for an illustration of my Vtuber!\n\nMy Vtuber is called Larity and she is a superhero who lives in space and has the power of gravity. Her personality is energetic and she has a fun sense of humour.\n\nI would love an illustration that focuses on her personality! It's also ok if you need to simplify any details.\nHere is a folder full of reference pictures:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1thlP00uzlr7Y-MwnnQKTt7MxAfhJn_8C?usp=drive_link\n\nI would love to use your art as decoration for my VTuber schedule or YouTube thumbnail in the future and I will credit you if that is okay with you?\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@momomo_906/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f57aa4be/uploads/origins/88d945e8-5e5a-4933-87c8-6005ca193411?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38069888834995917adbf492a35878cc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f57aa4be/uploads/origins/88d945e8-5e5a-4933-87c8-6005ca193411?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38069888834995917adbf492a35878cc, https://si.imgix.net/f57aa4be/uploads/origins/88d945e8-5e5a-4933-87c8-6005ca193411?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c999ae9c149fc9fa98b8a10b3a9086f5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f57aa4be/uploads/origins/88d945e8-5e5a-4933-87c8-6005ca193411?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0f2266a7b107987325f8dc94f032e95a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "MOMO